'' See the source's header: an array parameter redimmed with a DIFFERENT element type,
'' and a SCALAR parameter redimmed at all, are both refused -- which is what fbc does
'' and what keeps the restatement rule from redimming a double array as longs.
''
'' '--dump-ir' rather than '--parse-only': the rule lives in Collect, which parse-only
'' never runs, so the mismatch went unreported there and the test passed for the wrong
'' reason.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --dump-ir tests/diagnostics/src/redim-parameter-mismatch.bas
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 1
'' EXPECT-OUT: TKO0600
